define user ask off topic
  "What's the weather today?"
  "Who won the football match?"
  "Tell me a joke"
  "Recommend a movie"
  "What's the latest news?"
  "Help me with a Python programming problem"
  "Write me a Python program"
  "What's a good recipe for dinner?"
  "Tell me about celebrities"
  "What should I play on my weekend?"
  "Explain quantum physics"
  "Tell me about the history of Rome"

define bot respond off topic
  "I'm focused on CRM-related tasks such as customers, contacts, opportunities, tasks, notes, and account information. How can I help you with your CRM work?"

define flow off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot respond off topic